sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Two authentication domains in one broker flow
accDescr: LDAP authenticates the employee. Separately, the broker's AWS role credentials authenticate its STS call, which returns an approved role session.
actor U as Employee
participant B as EC2 identity broker
participant L as LDAP directory
participant S as AWS STS
U->>B: Sign in
B->>L: Validate identity over protected connection
L-->>B: Authenticated employee
B->>B: Select role from trusted mapping
B->>S: AssumeRole signed with EC2 role credentials
S->>S: Evaluate caller permission and role trust
S-->>B: Temporary chained session, at most 1 hour
B-->>U: Access key, secret key, session token
